WEBVTT

00:08.230 --> 00:16.450
Natsume Yujin-cho Go

01:45.730 --> 01:49.080
Ready?

01:52.400 --> 01:55.800
The stars are shiny-shiny.

01:55.800 --> 01:59.430
I drink sake and my head
goes spinny-spinny...

01:57.970 --> 01:59.430
Going somewhere?

02:00.450 --> 02:01.430
Yeah.

02:02.100 --> 02:04.930
That's your favorite cup, right?

02:04.930 --> 02:08.180
There's a banquet tonight
and I'm getting ready to go.

02:08.180 --> 02:09.830
This early?

02:09.830 --> 02:12.690
I've got to get a lot of snacks ready.

02:12.690 --> 02:13.720
Oh, right!

02:13.720 --> 02:15.320
You want to come, too?

02:15.740 --> 02:18.380
That's rare. You never invite me to banquets.

02:18.380 --> 02:21.850
It's a little different
than your usual banquet.

02:21.850 --> 02:26.210
If you're interested,
I'd be willing to take you.

02:27.770 --> 02:29.080
I'll pass.

02:29.080 --> 02:31.890
Aww, you're a wuss.

02:31.890 --> 02:33.340
Bye.

02:33.750 --> 02:37.680
Off to drink!

02:35.200 --> 02:37.210
It's not that I'm not interested, but...

02:38.340 --> 02:42.340
Banquet

02:38.340 --> 02:42.340
of

02:38.340 --> 02:42.340
Play

02:46.100 --> 02:49.380
What makes this banquet different, I wonder?

02:50.620 --> 02:53.420
Here's squid in your eye!

02:55.860 --> 02:58.910
Hey guys, drinkin' up?

03:01.800 --> 03:03.320
Let's get wasted!

03:04.870 --> 03:05.760
Oh, no!

03:05.760 --> 03:06.870
I'm starting to wonder about it!

03:06.870 --> 03:08.130
What?

03:08.130 --> 03:09.370
What's wrong, Natsume?

03:10.300 --> 03:12.940
No, it's nothing!

03:14.530 --> 03:18.640
I was having a great dream about
being friends with a girl, too.

03:18.640 --> 03:19.670
Sorry.

03:20.180 --> 03:22.860
You don't need to apologize.

03:26.640 --> 03:29.210
Maybe I should've said I'd go.

03:32.360 --> 03:33.770
Nyanko-sensei!

03:35.910 --> 03:36.870
Wait!

03:41.680 --> 03:43.420
Where'd he go?

03:44.800 --> 03:46.060
Sensei!

03:51.230 --> 03:53.260
A mansion, here?

03:55.600 --> 03:57.320
Excuse me!

04:00.670 --> 04:02.000
It's abandoned...

04:11.440 --> 04:14.120
This rock looks just like Nyanko-sensei.

04:15.550 --> 04:16.730
Sensei?

04:16.730 --> 04:19.570
You can't just come in here like this.

04:22.140 --> 04:24.570
That's not Sensei...

04:30.910 --> 04:32.520
Help me!

04:33.750 --> 04:35.120
This feeling...

04:35.120 --> 04:37.770
This is probably a youkai mansion.

04:37.770 --> 04:41.640
But that scream...
If some human wandered in...

04:42.740 --> 04:43.840
Excuse me!

04:45.060 --> 04:46.340
Are you okay?

04:46.750 --> 04:48.340
Is anyone here?

05:10.690 --> 05:13.950
Those shadows reminded me of the mid-ranks...

05:13.950 --> 05:16.370
Are they doing something here after all?

05:16.950 --> 05:18.660
Is Sensei here, too?

05:24.500 --> 05:26.010
A youkai?

05:26.470 --> 05:27.760
A person?

05:28.760 --> 05:30.510
It's covered in scratches.

05:37.260 --> 05:39.020
Are you okay?

05:39.020 --> 05:41.880
Yeah... You caught me.

05:41.880 --> 05:45.900
Now I'm it.

05:48.440 --> 05:51.160
Now hide.

05:58.790 --> 06:00.170
It's gone...

06:04.500 --> 06:05.670
There's quite a few of them here.

06:06.390 --> 06:10.930
I thought it was quiet, but suddenly
I can sense youkai on the move.

06:11.500 --> 06:14.310
I guess there aren't any humans here.

06:14.660 --> 06:17.230
I'll just leave before I run
into anything else weird.

06:19.870 --> 06:20.810
Huh?

06:20.810 --> 06:21.880
Hinoe!

06:21.880 --> 06:23.090
Natsume!

06:23.090 --> 06:25.070
What are you doing here?

06:25.540 --> 06:27.470
Are you participating?

06:27.470 --> 06:30.370
Nice! I've fallen in love
with you all over again!

06:30.370 --> 06:31.490
Participating?

06:31.490 --> 06:34.550
No, I was looking for Sensei
when I heard a scream...

06:34.550 --> 06:36.990
But this is dangerous for humans.

06:36.990 --> 06:37.930
Come here.

06:37.930 --> 06:39.710
You need to get out of this place.

06:39.710 --> 06:42.230
Yeah, thanks Hinoe.

06:42.230 --> 06:43.200
I appreciate it.

06:43.710 --> 06:45.430
Have a little.

06:45.430 --> 06:47.270
Just a little bittle!

06:47.270 --> 06:48.520
Not funny.

06:48.520 --> 06:50.380
You're late, Hinoe.

06:51.090 --> 06:52.690
Natsume-sama!

06:52.690 --> 06:54.380
Natsume-sama!

06:54.380 --> 06:55.530
The mid-ranks?

06:56.070 --> 06:58.120
I guess those were different youkai before.

06:58.540 --> 06:59.860
Where's Nyanko-sensei?

06:59.860 --> 07:01.100
He's not with you?

07:02.040 --> 07:04.930
Oh, Madara-sama?

07:04.930 --> 07:06.110
I don't know...

07:06.110 --> 07:09.310
Hinoe, where'd you see Natsume-sama?

07:09.310 --> 07:11.200
Where'dja run into him?

07:11.200 --> 07:13.370
Oh, well...

07:13.970 --> 07:15.120
The Kaiyuutei?

07:15.500 --> 07:21.750
It belongs to the master of a valley
near Misumidake, Yuuzuru-sama.

07:21.750 --> 07:24.470
He's a very strange being...

07:24.470 --> 07:29.830
Sometimes he'll gather youkai and play
a game for control of the valley.

07:29.830 --> 07:31.760
Control of the valley?

07:31.760 --> 07:32.730
Yes.

07:32.730 --> 07:35.780
But he's very good at the game,

07:35.780 --> 07:37.570
so he always wins.

07:37.570 --> 07:40.270
Win-win-win!

07:40.270 --> 07:41.880
Then that was...

07:41.880 --> 07:45.870
Yes, the game's on right now.

07:45.870 --> 07:47.950
It'll last three more days.

07:48.740 --> 07:52.780
So the presences in the mansion
were youkai playing the game?

07:52.780 --> 07:56.820
I was sure you were going to take
control of the area around Misumi

07:56.820 --> 07:59.540
and start to enhance your spirit power.

07:59.540 --> 08:01.910
You're just a bean sprout,
but you've got big plans, huh?

08:02.700 --> 08:04.830
Are you finally ready to raise an army?

08:04.830 --> 08:07.650
You went to take out Yuuzuru-sama, huh?

08:07.650 --> 08:09.250
A grand romance!

08:09.250 --> 08:10.710
Roman... Meron!

08:10.710 --> 08:11.670
No!

08:11.670 --> 08:15.700
You can't count on that cat-ball, after all.

08:15.700 --> 08:20.810
You could just be the boss
of all the youkai here.

08:21.920 --> 08:24.280
If somebody like that
had the Book of Friends,

08:24.280 --> 08:27.190
even if they said they wouldn't use it,
no one would believe them.

08:27.190 --> 08:30.320
Jeez, what a pain...

08:30.320 --> 08:31.890
Well, if you're not interested,

08:31.890 --> 08:34.220
then just stay away from there.

08:34.220 --> 08:36.200
Yeah, I will.

08:41.610 --> 08:44.330
Sensei's not back yet?

08:46.180 --> 08:48.790
I wanted to show this to him.

08:50.000 --> 08:53.500
What was this weird banquet
that Sensei was going to?

08:54.260 --> 08:56.570
Once he gets back, I'll ask him.

08:57.510 --> 09:00.100
Ready?

09:02.590 --> 09:03.680
Where am I?

09:04.610 --> 09:06.100
The Kaiyuutei?

09:06.100 --> 09:08.790
No, this is a dream.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.110
Hey!

09:10.940 --> 09:12.430
Be quiet!

09:12.430 --> 09:15.360
You need to hide, or he'll find you!

09:15.360 --> 09:17.920
Find me? Hide?

09:17.920 --> 09:20.470
Ready?

09:26.810 --> 09:29.380
I guess I'll stay here until I wake up.

09:29.380 --> 09:31.940
Is this the game called hide-and-seek?

09:31.940 --> 09:34.270
Ready?

09:34.270 --> 09:36.630
Ready!

09:37.760 --> 09:39.390
Someone was in here already!

10:01.980 --> 10:03.690
That was close.

10:03.690 --> 10:06.010
He almost found me.

10:06.540 --> 10:07.840
No, wait.

10:07.840 --> 10:09.170
That was just a dream.

10:09.170 --> 10:11.250
It's not my problem.

10:15.690 --> 10:18.130
Ready?

10:18.130 --> 10:19.760
I'm back!

10:19.760 --> 10:22.110
Hey, the next one's coming!

10:22.110 --> 10:23.370
You need to run, too!

10:48.730 --> 10:50.200
I can't sleep...

10:52.040 --> 10:55.040
Natsume Yujin-cho Go

10:59.440 --> 11:00.840
Hey, Natsume.

11:01.300 --> 11:02.400
What's wrong?

11:02.400 --> 11:04.750
I had a bad dream last night...

11:04.750 --> 11:07.260
Yeah, I know what you mean.

11:07.260 --> 11:11.310
A dream where you've got a test
and you haven't studied at all!

11:11.810 --> 11:14.940
Hey, is there a way to always
win at hide-and-seek?

11:14.940 --> 11:17.280
What's this about?

11:17.280 --> 11:20.910
Hmm, I don't know...

11:20.910 --> 11:23.950
You just have to keep hiding, right?

11:23.950 --> 11:26.050
You used to do it when you were a kid, right?

11:27.640 --> 11:31.350
I have no memories of playing
hide-and-seek with my friends.

11:32.930 --> 11:35.210
Ready?

11:35.210 --> 11:37.260
Not yet!

11:37.910 --> 11:39.750
Ready?

11:40.420 --> 11:42.590
Ready!

11:49.420 --> 11:50.850
Tomota, I found you!

11:54.800 --> 11:56.610
I found you!

12:03.960 --> 12:05.630
Um...

12:05.630 --> 12:07.430
What's wrong, Natsume?

12:07.430 --> 12:09.400
Were you having a nightmare?

12:13.150 --> 12:14.540
So that's what happened.

12:14.540 --> 12:18.090
You were probably seen
as a participant.

12:18.090 --> 12:19.800
Participate! Participate!

12:19.800 --> 12:23.820
No... I wasn't even "it" back then!

12:23.820 --> 12:27.050
But well, you're a part of the game now.

12:27.050 --> 12:30.230
So why not just win and take the valley?

12:30.230 --> 12:31.180
No way.

12:32.330 --> 12:35.560
But I can't take another two days of this.

12:37.310 --> 12:41.270
The way to win at hide-and-seek is
to hide until time runs out, right?

12:41.270 --> 12:46.700
I guess whoever becomes "it" the least
number of times during the game wins...

12:46.700 --> 12:49.540
So whether they find me or I become "it."

12:49.540 --> 12:52.310
as long as I don't win, I don't care.d

12:52.820 --> 12:55.960
It's harsh, not being able
to sleep for two days.

12:56.360 --> 12:58.840
I'd love to talk to Sensei about it,

12:58.840 --> 13:00.840
but he's not back yet.

13:00.840 --> 13:04.750
Does that mean that right now you're free?

13:04.750 --> 13:07.760
I can visit you in your bed at night?

13:08.980 --> 13:12.670
But that bodyguard was never
worth anything to begin with.

13:12.670 --> 13:14.820
Does it really matter if he's gone?

13:14.820 --> 13:16.360
Right? Right?

13:16.360 --> 13:18.430
Can't see! Can't hear!

13:18.430 --> 13:20.110
This sounds interesting.

13:22.220 --> 13:23.200
Misuzu!

13:23.200 --> 13:27.530
Very well, in the place of
that four-legged rice cake,

13:27.530 --> 13:30.120
we shall be your bodyguards.

13:30.310 --> 13:37.120
And in doing so, we can show you that we
are more useful than that bowling ball.

13:37.120 --> 13:38.810
A great idea!

13:38.810 --> 13:39.980
I love it!

13:39.980 --> 13:43.520
Let's decide who Natsume belongs to!

13:43.520 --> 13:46.040
And let's start with a drink!

13:46.040 --> 13:48.550
A drink! A drink!

13:48.550 --> 13:52.230
Come on, Natsume-sama! Pour me a drink!

13:52.230 --> 13:54.140
Cut it out!

13:54.140 --> 13:57.650
Yuuzuru-sama is a strange being,

13:57.650 --> 14:00.390
but an understanding one.

14:00.390 --> 14:01.310
Mustache?

14:01.310 --> 14:03.660
Why not go to the mansion,

14:03.660 --> 14:08.600
play the game, and while you do,
search for the mansion's owner

14:08.600 --> 14:10.420
and have them free you from the game?

14:10.420 --> 14:12.160
Wouldn't that be the fastest way?

14:12.600 --> 14:15.610
He's got a dumb-looking face, but he's right.

14:15.610 --> 14:17.630
He sure does...

14:17.630 --> 14:21.040
I'm always right!

14:21.040 --> 14:24.680
If you want to move around,
it's better if you're "it."

14:24.680 --> 14:29.300
While you're "it," we'll search
for Yuuzuru secretly.

14:29.300 --> 14:32.680
Okay, members of the Dogs Circle,

14:32.680 --> 14:36.360
let's do our best as
Natsume-sama's bodyguards!

14:36.360 --> 14:37.640
Yay!

14:38.520 --> 14:41.230
And so the members of the Dogs Circle

14:41.230 --> 14:44.010
became my bodyguards and helped me.

14:42.840 --> 14:44.820
Ready?

15:01.910 --> 15:03.090
I found you!

15:03.090 --> 15:05.800
Now, you're "it."

15:05.800 --> 15:08.470
Oh, you found me, huh?

15:08.990 --> 15:10.720
What do I do?

15:10.720 --> 15:17.430
You say that you're "it" now,
and keep saying, "Ready?"

15:17.430 --> 15:20.330
while you count to 100.

15:20.330 --> 15:21.610
I see.

15:21.610 --> 15:23.310
It's basically the same as the human version.

15:23.860 --> 15:26.100
No, more importantly,

15:26.100 --> 15:28.610
what's Yuuzuru-sama like it?

15:28.610 --> 15:31.950
Bold, but fragile.

15:31.950 --> 15:33.140
Even more than you.

15:33.140 --> 15:34.370
More than me?

15:34.370 --> 15:36.920
Then is he really like this?

15:36.920 --> 15:38.870
That's definitely him.

15:38.870 --> 15:41.610
Mustache's info was right, huh?

15:42.990 --> 15:46.780
This is probably the youkai
I touched at the start, isn't it?

15:47.290 --> 15:48.880
Okay, got it.

15:48.880 --> 15:49.880
All right...

15:50.270 --> 15:51.810
I'm "it" now!

15:53.500 --> 15:54.770
There's a new "it"!

15:54.770 --> 15:55.740
Want to move?

15:55.740 --> 15:57.390
No, I'll stay here.

15:59.320 --> 16:00.640
Natsume-sama!

16:00.640 --> 16:02.070
Over here!

16:02.070 --> 16:05.000
I'm "it." Let's split up.

16:05.000 --> 16:06.990
You guys search the second floor.

16:06.990 --> 16:08.900
Natsume, you come with me.

16:08.900 --> 16:11.110
Shut up, lover-girl.

16:11.110 --> 16:14.130
I am the one who is worthy
to go with Natsume-dono.

16:14.130 --> 16:17.980
You can't go into the mansion,
so you're out of the question.

16:18.600 --> 16:21.910
Now come with us, Natsume-sama!

16:23.020 --> 16:24.170
What about Mustache?

16:25.550 --> 16:29.270
I'll stay out here and watch the fun.

16:29.850 --> 16:32.360
I hate to say it, but he looks cool!

16:32.360 --> 16:34.050
I'd rather go with Mustache...

16:34.050 --> 16:37.800
Oh, Natsume, don't be like that!

16:37.800 --> 16:39.810
Come on, Natsume-sama!

16:39.810 --> 16:43.360
Come adventure with us while we have a drink!

16:43.360 --> 16:45.690
This is too much work.

16:46.250 --> 16:49.440
I could just smash the mansion
and drive him out that way.

16:50.450 --> 16:52.840
G-Get off me!

16:56.100 --> 16:58.330
They're helping me, too...

16:58.330 --> 17:00.330
I need to apologize later.

17:04.330 --> 17:05.930
You're not Yuuzuru-sama.

17:07.080 --> 17:08.160
Huh?

17:09.480 --> 17:12.150
Natsume-sama, we found him!

17:12.150 --> 17:13.590
He's here! He's here!

17:13.590 --> 17:14.560
Where?

17:14.560 --> 17:15.770
The second floor!

17:15.770 --> 17:16.340
Good.

17:19.750 --> 17:20.760
Where?

17:21.480 --> 17:24.120
Natsume-dono, he's on the first floor.

17:24.120 --> 17:25.100
What?

17:25.100 --> 17:26.630
I saw him with my own eyes.

17:26.630 --> 17:27.710
Okay.

17:29.680 --> 17:31.020
He went upstairs!

17:31.640 --> 17:32.980
He's in the courtyard!

17:36.800 --> 17:39.380
Where is he? Jeez!

17:39.840 --> 17:42.540
Natsume-sama, I found him!

17:43.120 --> 17:45.310
Cut it out!

17:46.970 --> 17:49.540
Now I understand what makes Sensei so great.

17:50.670 --> 17:52.290
He drinks too much, but he's compact!

17:52.290 --> 17:55.240
All I need is cushions and I'm happy!

17:57.350 --> 17:58.520
That voice!

18:01.050 --> 18:01.890
Are you "it"?

18:03.070 --> 18:04.150
I am.

18:22.360 --> 18:23.910
You're Yuuzuru-sama, right?

18:23.910 --> 18:25.380
I'm sorry.

18:25.380 --> 18:27.640
I didn't realize that you were in
the midst of an important game;

18:27.640 --> 18:29.060
I simply wandered in here.

18:29.690 --> 18:33.170
This is too difficult a
game for a human to play.

18:33.620 --> 18:36.360
I've come to ask you to allow me to leave.

18:38.170 --> 18:39.400
Where is he?

18:39.400 --> 18:41.680
I'm sure the voice came from this room.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.690
The closet?

18:43.220 --> 18:44.180
The ceiling?

18:44.180 --> 18:45.560
The desk?

18:45.560 --> 18:46.930
Under the tatami mats?

18:48.660 --> 18:50.250
No, listen carefully...

18:50.750 --> 18:51.800
This is...

18:55.310 --> 18:58.790
It's a muffled voice,
from a very cramped space...

19:08.130 --> 19:09.370
Yuuzuru-sama.

19:10.100 --> 19:11.530
Please let me leave the game.

19:20.860 --> 19:22.100
Please.

19:22.510 --> 19:24.590
You don't want the right to rule?

19:24.590 --> 19:25.290
I don't.

19:25.720 --> 19:27.790
You can't play with me?

19:27.790 --> 19:28.680
I can't.

19:29.310 --> 19:31.020
I must return.

19:33.350 --> 19:34.630
I see.

19:34.630 --> 19:37.150
Looking closer, I see the
bags under your eyes.

19:37.150 --> 19:40.400
I guess I can't play with the
children of man after all.

19:42.350 --> 19:43.660
Very well.

19:43.660 --> 19:45.270
You may leave.

19:45.270 --> 19:50.040
Now touch me once more and make me "it."

19:50.040 --> 19:52.040
I'm sorry.

19:54.770 --> 19:56.540
It was just a whim...

19:56.540 --> 19:59.460
I just invited you to
join for no real reason.

19:59.970 --> 20:04.680
You, the child of man who looked
with sorrow on my wounds...

20:07.790 --> 20:09.650
I am "it" now.

20:14.810 --> 20:16.570
Natsume! Natsume!

20:16.570 --> 20:18.110
Yay! Yay!

20:17.150 --> 20:18.110
Stop it!

20:18.110 --> 20:19.690
Have a drink, Natsume-sama!

20:19.690 --> 20:21.870
See how great we are?

20:21.870 --> 20:25.620
Well done, Dogs Circle!

20:25.620 --> 20:28.800
He did most of it himself, didn't he?

20:28.800 --> 20:32.330
Stop it!

20:34.710 --> 20:36.350
I can finally sleep.

20:37.820 --> 20:40.570
Sensei, are you back yet?

20:41.810 --> 20:44.890
I was sure he was playing
the game at the Kaiyuutei.

20:45.590 --> 20:49.650
I still haven't shown him this
rock that looks like him.

20:51.260 --> 20:52.940
I hope he comes home soon,

20:53.550 --> 20:56.110
and complains about something...

20:56.780 --> 20:58.350
Don't tell me this rock

20:58.350 --> 21:00.930
is actually Sensei and he was the
victim of a curse or something!

21:00.930 --> 21:02.870
I'm back!

21:03.500 --> 21:04.360
Sensei!

21:06.110 --> 21:07.820
That was so much fun!

21:07.820 --> 21:11.140
I feel so good!

21:11.140 --> 21:13.070
Where were you, Sensei?

21:13.070 --> 21:15.840
A banquet, just like I said.

21:15.840 --> 21:20.630
A pond in Shinomiya turns to sake
and you dip your cup in it and sip.

21:20.630 --> 21:24.040
That's what I call a drinking party!

21:24.040 --> 21:25.250
A drinking party?

21:25.250 --> 21:26.570
It's been two days.

21:26.570 --> 21:27.640
Yeah.

21:27.640 --> 21:32.690
We drank all through the night, and then
the next day, and then the next night!

21:32.690 --> 21:35.240
A drinker's paradise!

21:35.240 --> 21:37.190
It was so good!

21:37.190 --> 21:40.000
But didn't you go into the Kaiyuutei?

21:40.000 --> 21:41.510
Huh? Oh, right.

21:41.510 --> 21:43.650
That's a shortcut.

21:44.910 --> 21:46.710
What's this rock?

21:48.170 --> 21:49.530
It's nothing!

21:51.040 --> 21:52.180
Stupid bodyguard.

21:52.180 --> 21:53.320
I'm going to sleep.

21:53.320 --> 21:54.520
What?

21:54.520 --> 21:56.540
What were you doing just now?

21:56.540 --> 21:57.580
You go to sleep, too!

21:57.580 --> 21:59.000
You brat!

21:59.000 --> 22:02.080
Tomorrow I'm finding whatever that was!
